Blocking-pool threads take the runtime's thread_stack_size instead of the
standard library default (2 MiB), so work moved off a worker keeps the stack
the worker had.

diff --git a/src/runtime/blocking_pool.rs b/src/runtime/blocking_pool.rs
index b6bac66..a13ad99 100644
